bc.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a moonspawn oozecrown.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>&lt;Blrrrpp&gt;</li><li>&lt;Pffshhht&gt;</li><li>&lt;Shlooom&gt;</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>The oozecrown manifests as a swollen accumulation of growth, layered with shifting and unstable matter. It seems less concerned with movement and more with expansion, slowly reshaping its surroundings. Its surface pulses irregularly, suggesting ongoing internal processes that are not fully understood. Areas under its influence tend to become difficult to traverse, as if the environment itself resists intrusion. Those who approach too closely may find themselves overwhelmed by its unpredictable nature.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Moonspawn_Artwork-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:152px;\"><img alt=\"Official Creature Artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Official \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Moonspawn_Artwork_3292ec.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Moonspawn Artwork.jpg (519 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></